      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِيهِ قَرَبَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِرَابَةٌ</span></b>  are said of a vessel that is
